  "slug": "this-is-my-boyfriend",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/18951_this-is-my-boyfriend.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "I have a boyfriend, his name is Zhang Yang. He is neither fat nor thin, very tall and likes sports. We have known each other for three and a half years. Zhang Yang is my brother's classmate, but my brother is not satisfied with him because he has no job. Zhang Yang has a sister who is a middle school student. I like this girl very much. She is very smart and cute. Zhang Yang’s mother is a nurse and his father works in a small company. I haven’t met them yet. This is my boyfriend and his family, what do you think?"
  ],
  "english_full": "I have a boyfriend, his name is Zhang Yang. He is neither fat nor thin, very tall and likes sports. We have known each other for three and a half years. Zhang Yang is my brother's classmate, but my brother is not satisfied with him because he has no job. Zhang Yang has a sister who is a middle school student. I like this girl very much. She is very smart and cute. Zhang Yang’s mother is a nurse and his father works in a small company. I haven’t met them yet. This is my boyfriend and his family, what do you think?",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "У меня е́сть бойфре́нд, его и́мя Чжан Я́н. Он та́кже не то́лстый, ни худо́й, высо́кий и люби́т спорт. Мы зна́ем друг дру́га уже три с полови́ной года. Чжан Я́н — однока́шник моего́ бра́та, но мой брат не дово́лен е́м из-за того, что у не́го нет рабо́ты. У Чжана Я́на е́сть се́стра, кото́рая учи́тся в сре́дней шко́ле. Мне о́чень на́до э́та де́вушка. Она о́чень умная и ми́лая. Ма́ма Чжана Я́на — медсестра́, а его́ ба́тька рабо́тает в ма́лой компа́нии. Я ещё не встре́чал их. Э́то мой бойфре́нд и его́ семья́, как вы ду́маете?"
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "U menya yest' boyfrénd, yevo ímya Chzhan Yán. On tákzhe ne tóls'tyy, ni khudóy, vysokýy i lyubít sport. My znáem drug drugá uzhe tri s polovinóy goda. Chzhan Yán — odnokláschnik moegó bráta, no moy brat ne dovolén yém iz-za togo, chto u négo net rabótý. U Chzhana Yána yest' séstra, kotoráya uchítsya v srédney shkóle. Mne óchen' nádo étá devúshka. Ona óchen' úmnaya i mílayá. Máma Chzhana Yána — medséstra, a yevo bátyka rabótayet v máloy kompánii. Ya yeshchó ne vstretchál ikh. Éto moy boyfrénd i yevo sem'yá, kak vy dún'chóíte?"
  ],
